{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fresh take on deckbuilding using Rune-based combat in this strategic turn-based roguelite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/a52b92a1abc8b9caa287d67cf4b1c7fc.poster.avif?t=1759887314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/a52b92a1abc8b9caa287d67cf4b1c7fc.webm?t=1759887314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/a52b92a1abc8b9caa287d67cf4b1c7fc.mp4?t=1759887314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path through mystical realms in your attempt to reach Ariah, using an innovative 2x3 rune grid system. Combine Action, Passive, and Catalyst runes to create devastating combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/3195bf052bd4eed6c7717f187426f069.poster.avif?t=1759887314\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/3195bf052bd4eed6c7717f187426f069.webm?t=1759887314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/3195bf052bd4eed6c7717f187426f069.mp4?t=1759887314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Rune System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2x3 Grid Combat:</strong>\u00a0Use runes strategically depending on their placement in the grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rune type serves a purpose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Runes:</strong> Your primary combat tools requiring manual activation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive Runes:</strong> Automatically trigger each turn for consistent benefits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catalyst Runes:</strong> Enhance adjacent runes with multipliers and bonuses</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/707e4b9f7604f8d8841c38671ba72811.avif?t=1759887314\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Deep Strategic Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Roguelike Progression </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Unique Characters &amp; Abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EmberMonk:</strong> Master of flame and inner strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Specific Abilities:</strong> Each character has unique  abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Builds:</strong> Choose from unlocked abilities to create your perfect playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/ad272db763ff1dc9fb54c3e3918b5092.avif?t=1759887314\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat That Rewards Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional deckbuilding card games, Trial of Ariah's rune system gives you a fresh take on a beloved gaming system. The 2x3 grid creates spatial strategy where rune placement matters as much as rune selection. Catalyst runes transform adjacent abilities - a simple damage rune becomes devastating when buffed by a Triple Right catalyst.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently Available:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete rune-based combat system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural map generation for endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first zone with an end boss</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional playable characters with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More areas and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded enemy roster and boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced story elements and world-building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality of life improvements based on community feedback</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Embark on your trial. Master the runes. Discover what lies beyond. But can you reach Ariah?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938190?t=1759887314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/7165b8397025d157f715236b7f686c75fd53f0e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759887314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/d0677efaf0434b22fa998bcd051727bd75463b6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759887314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/d0677efaf0434b22fa998bcd051727bd75463b6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759887314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3959510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s